<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Your settlement was paid</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff;">
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>Velexis paid the settlement of your OTA {{tenantName}} ({{tenantKey}}) for {{period}} by bank transfer to your payout account: {{netAmount}}, sent on {{paidOn}} with the bank reference {{payoutReference}}.</p>
    <p>The statement and its lines, as a CSV file, are in the portal: <a href="{{statementUrl}}">{{statementUrl}}</a></p>
    <p>The Velexis team</p>
  </body>
</html>
